        {
          "en": "By becoming the most metropolitan region in Asia, the delta drew global talent.",
          "highlight": [
            "most metropolitan"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "透過成為亞洲最具大都會規模的地區，該三角洲吸引了全球人才。"
